Package: erhai-motion
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Motion sensor input device for the OnePlus Pad 3
 Presents the accelerometer and gyroscope of the sensor core as an input
 device with the motion sensor layout of game controllers, for games and
 other programs that read motion. The sensors stream only while a program
 holds the device open.
